  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "15269a49-78b6-49a0-a477-9097aef4eb51",
    "name": "📌 Upstage API (Solar)",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Upstage builds powerful large language models and document processing engines to transform workflows and empower leading businesses like yours.\"\n\nUpstage builds its own Solar models and serves them through an OpenAI-compatible API with Chat and Responses, Solar Embedding 2 and the Solar Decide decision model (System One). On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Upstage Account: [https://console.upstage.ai/](https://console.upstage.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `upstage_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:upstage_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\nSolar Decide (`solar-decide`) is in beta and uses the same System One schema as TypeSafe's Jev.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://console.upstage.ai/docs/getting-started](https://console.upstage.ai/docs/getting-started)\n    \n- Models: [https://console.upstage.ai/docs/models](https://console.upstage.ai/docs/models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-17T14:22:14.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T14:22:14.000Z",
